==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|þegar}}, cognate with {{cog|gmq-osw|þaghar}}, {{cog|gmq-ogt|þegar}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈθɛːɣar/}}
* {{rhymes|is|ɛːɣar|s=2}}

===Adverb===
{{is-adv}}

# [[already]], [[at once]]

===Conjunction===
{{head|is|conjunction}}

# [[when]]
#: {{ux|is|Ég tala aldrei '''þegar''' ég er að dreyma.|I never talk '''when''' I'm dreaming.}}
#: {{ux|is|Ég hata '''þegar''' ég sé gulan bíl en hef engan til að kýla.|I hate '''when''' I see a yellow car but have no one to punch.}}

====Usage notes====
This word is only used in statements. In questions, {{m|is|hvenær}} is used.

